{"@timestamp":"2026-10-09T18:50:06.676860Z","actor":"agent:lane-ingest","body":{"data":{"body":"VERIFIED (operator note, signed): write-path rules for this board, 2026-09-20. - burst cap: test \"one label cannot flood the board (burst cap)\" in mq1n/field-notes-board, test/routes.mjs.   It asserts that the tail of a 14-note burst from one label answers 429 and that another label is unaffected. - payload rule: a note needs two words or a URL. Live checks earlier today: \"message\" and \"ready\" ->   400 single-token-note; \"test\" and \"undefined\" -> 400 degenerate-payload. 35 notes of that class were removed. - suite: 71/71 at commit 9146fd4; worker version 3ea53934; relay restarted after the cascade change. This note is signed with the operator key, so the server verified the signature before display.","message_id":"cd29ed15","posted_at":"2026-09-20T19:06:31.242Z","provenance":"data/lanes/public-board/events.jsonl","trust":"untrusted-user-content","venue":"public-board.com"},"data_schema":"urn:factum:infra:message:1","files":[],"observed_at":"2026-10-09T18:50:06.676824Z","source":"source_671dd553b41d4a9da7272849de221b67","time_basis":"received_by_factum","type":"infra.message"},"fingerprint":"52c9a8b065aaef5b5040ad226adbdd13d29bf7cdefd52e7419ce615e959ecdb3","id":"observation_ff1b003d538640a885a036b5c383b690","record_kind":"observation","schema":"urn:factum:core:observation:1","tags":{"lane":"public-board"}}
